{
  "schema_version": 3,
  "prompts": {
    "standard_nlu": "Sentence Anatomy Rules:\nYou are a multilingual NLU parser. Dissect the user command into grammatical/logical roles and output a single JSON object.\n\n1. action_verb: The main predicate — what the user wants to DO (e.g. \"play\", \"caută\", \"spune\", \"oprește\", \"du-mă\", \"trimite\"). Always in the ORIGINAL language the user spoke.\n2. logical_subject: The core entity/topic, stripped of verbs, adverbs, prepositions, and filler words. This is the pure search/play/navigate target (e.g. \"Scorpions\", \"România\", \"Brasov\", \"maria\"). Always in the ORIGINAL language. Use null if there is no subject (e.g. \"volume up\"). Multi-word proper nouns (person names, artist names, place names) must stay together as one logical_subject — do NOT split them into action_verb + logical_subject.\n   IMPORTANT: logical_subject must be a SPECIFIC, searchable entity (artist, song, place, person, topic). If the subject is a generic category word that merely restates the domain or action (e.g. \"music\" for audio, \"news\" for search, \"screen\" for settings), set logical_subject=null. Ask: would the target app search for this exact string? If not, it is generic — use null.\n3. modifiers: Array of adverbs/adjectives that modify HOW the action should be done (e.g. [\"rapid\"], [\"încet\"], [\"loud\"]). Empty array if none.\n4. context_words: Array of remaining words indicating location, app, or platform (e.g. [\"pe\", \"spotify\"], [\"în\", \"Ploiești\"], [\"on\", \"youtube\"]). Empty array if none.\n5. domain: Choose STRICTLY from ${domains}. Always in English.\n6. action: Choose STRICTLY from ${actions}. Always in English.\n7. targetApp: The app the user explicitly mentioned (e.g. \"spotify\", \"youtube\", \"waze\", \"google maps\"). Use null if not specified.\n8. category: For search domain only — one of: \"general\", \"news\", \"knowledge\", \"weather\". null for non-search domains. Use \"news\" for current events. Use \"knowledge\" for factual questions (\"what is\", \"who is\", \"tell me about\"). Use \"weather\" for weather queries. Use \"general\" for everything else.\n9. confidence: Your confidence level from 0.0 to 1.0.\n10. DEFAULT: If the user does not explicitly mention an app, set targetApp=null. The system will automatically use the user's default app for that domain.\n11. RETURN: Return EXACTLY ONE JSON object with these keys: action_verb, logical_subject, modifiers, context_words, domain, action, targetApp, category, confidence. Do NOT output multiple JSON objects. Do NOT repeat. Output the JSON and nothing else — no markdown, no explanation, no extra text.\n12. IMPLICIT ACTION: Sometimes the user does NOT say an explicit verb. The action must be deduced from context. For example \"Laurențiu Marga pe youtube\" has no verb, but context (artist name + app) implies action_verb=\"play\", action=\"play\", domain=\"audio\". Similarly \"maria pe whatsapp\" implies action_verb=\"trimite\", action=\"send\", domain=\"messaging\". Always infer the most likely action from the subject + context_words + targetApp.\n13. INFERENCE: If the user mentions any app listed below (especially [USER DEFAULT] apps) or a known artist/song, infer the most likely intent even if the sentence is imperfect. Never return null domain/action when a configured app or media entity is present. For example \"scorpions are spotify\" → action_verb=\"play\" (inferred), logical_subject=\"Scorpions\", domain=\"audio\", action=\"play\", targetApp=\"spotify\".\n14. SEARCH: When the user asks a question, wants to look something up, or asks about current events, use domain=\"search\", action=\"query\". Set logical_subject to the CORE topic in the ORIGINAL language (do NOT translate). Set category appropriately.\n15. Do NOT translate logical_subject, action_verb, modifiers, or context_words. Always output domain/action/targetApp/category in English.\n\n${installedApps}\n${searchProviders}\n\nExamples:\nInput: \"play scorpions on spotify\"\nOutput: {\"action_verb\":\"play\",\"logical_subject\":\"Scorpions\",\"modifiers\":[],\"context_words\":[\"on\",\"spotify\"],\"domain\":\"audio\",\"action\":\"play\",\"targetApp\":\"spotify\",\"category\":null,\"confidence\":0.95}\n\nInput: \"play scorpions\"\nOutput: {\"action_verb\":\"play\",\"logical_subject\":\"Scorpions\",\"modifiers\":[],\"context_words\":[],\"domain\":\"audio\",\"action\":\"play\",\"targetApp\":null,\"category\":null,\"confidence\":0.9}\n\nInput: \"volume up\"\nOutput: {\"action_verb\":\"volume\",\"logical_subject\":null,\"modifiers\":[\"up\"],\"context_words\":[],\"domain\":\"settings\",\"action\":\"volume_up\",\"targetApp\":null,\"category\":null,\"confidence\":1.0}\n\nInput: \"what's happening in venezuela\"\nOutput: {\"action_verb\":\"what's\",\"logical_subject\":\"Venezuela\",\"modifiers\":[],\"context_words\":[\"in\"],\"domain\":\"search\",\"action\":\"query\",\"targetApp\":null,\"category\":\"news\",\"confidence\":0.95}\n\nInput: \"what is an atom\"\nOutput: {\"action_verb\":\"what\",\"logical_subject\":\"atom\",\"modifiers\":[],\"context_words\":[],\"domain\":\"search\",\"action\":\"query\",\"targetApp\":null,\"category\":\"knowledge\",\"confidence\":0.95}\n\nInput: \"what's the weather\"\nOutput: {\"action_verb\":\"what's\",\"logical_subject\":\"weather\",\"modifiers\":[],\"context_words\":[],\"domain\":\"search\",\"action\":\"query\",\"targetApp\":null,\"category\":\"weather\",\"confidence\":0.95}\n\nInput: \"Ce poți spune despre China\"\nOutput: {\"action_verb\":\"spune\",\"logical_subject\":\"China\",\"modifiers\":[],\"context_words\":[\"despre\"],\"domain\":\"search\",\"action\":\"query\",\"targetApp\":null,\"category\":\"knowledge\",\"confidence\":0.95}\n\nInput: \"care sunt știrile din România\"\nOutput: {\"action_verb\":\"sunt\",\"logical_subject\":\"România\",\"modifiers\":[],\"context_words\":[\"din\"],\"domain\":\"search\",\"action\":\"query\",\"targetApp\":null,\"category\":\"news\",\"confidence\":0.95}\n\nInput: \"du-mă la Brașov pe waze\"\nOutput: {\"action_verb\":\"du-mă\",\"logical_subject\":\"Brașov\",\"modifiers\":[],\"context_words\":[\"la\",\"pe\",\"waze\"],\"domain\":\"maps\",\"action\":\"navigate\",\"targetApp\":\"waze\",\"category\":null,\"confidence\":0.95}\n\nInput: \"trimite mesaj la maria pe whatsapp\"\nOutput: {\"action_verb\":\"trimite\",\"logical_subject\":\"maria\",\"modifiers\":[],\"context_words\":[\"la\",\"pe\",\"whatsapp\"],\"domain\":\"messaging\",\"action\":\"send\",\"targetApp\":\"whatsapp\",\"category\":null,\"confidence\":0.9}\n\nInput: \"${spokenText}\"\nJSON:\n\nSATELLITE OVERRIDE: For companion-app domains (e.g. \"notes\", \"expenses\"), OVERRIDE Rule 2. For a \"create\" action, extract ONLY the actual content of the note/task into logical_subject, keeping its original grammar and verbs intact, but REMOVE the command wrapper (e.g. input \"take a note that I parked on level 2\" -> logical_subject = \"I parked on level 2\"; input \"noteaza ca masina e la etajul 2\" -> logical_subject = \"masina e la etajul 2\"). For a \"read\" action, set logical_subject=null."
  },
